{"id":"259a49a81c462a67","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/900_Dunn_相关逻辑.md","title":"900 Dunn 相关逻辑","display":"900_Dunn_相关逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"900-Dunn-相关逻辑\">900 Dunn 相关逻辑</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为固定可数无限原子集合。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}\\)</span> 五个构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Dunn 相关逻辑的目标特征是把 De Morgan 否定的正负分配公理作为显式公理族加入相关蕴含内核。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与替换\">2. 公式与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}(A)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{neg}(A[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{and}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{or}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{or}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{imp}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该语言没有绑定构造子。定义有限原子集、绑定名函数与新原子选择函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为句法相等：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Dunn}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Dunn}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-公理族\">3. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(B,C),\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\operatorname{imp}(A,C))):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(A,A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D1}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)),\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D1}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)),\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D2}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B)),\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D2}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B)),\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D3}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)),\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D3}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)),\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B)),\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4}=\\{\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B)),\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D3}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D3}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-分离规则\">4. 分离规则</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^n\\)</span>。分离规则关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 的子集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B));B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B));B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-证明序列\">5. 证明序列</h1>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，Dunn 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1})\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span> 且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>，至少满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\Gamma,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>或存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_k=\\operatorname{imp}(A_j,A_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_k=\\operatorname{imp}(A_j,A_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第三种情况要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k);A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\">\\(((A_j,A_k);A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1}):\\pi\\text{ 是从 }\\Gamma\\text{ 出发的 Dunn 证明且 }A_{n-1}=A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\{\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{n-1}):\\pi\\text{ 是从 }\\Gamma\\text{ 出发的 Dunn 证明且 }A_{n-1}=A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-可导性\">6. 可导性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}A\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义证明证书集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-定理集合\">7. 定理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Dunn 相关逻辑的正负分配差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DunnNeg}(A,B)\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)),\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))),\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B)),\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))),\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)),\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))),\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B)),\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)))\n\\bigr),\n\\qquad A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DunnNeg}(A,B)\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)),\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))),\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{or}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B)),\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))),\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)),\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B))),\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{and}(\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\operatorname{neg}(B)),\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)))\n\\bigr),\n\\qquad A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{D1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D2},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D3},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4},\\operatorname{DunnNeg}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{D1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D2},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D3},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4},\\operatorname{DunnNeg}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D2},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D3},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\operatorname{DunnNeg},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{B},\\mathsf{Ax}_{I},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D2},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D3},\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}},\\operatorname{DunnNeg},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Dunn}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 Dunn 相关逻辑的句法证明关系；不含四值矩阵语义或代数完备性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"900-Dunn-相关逻辑","text":"900 Dunn 相关逻辑","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与替换","text":"2. 公式与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-公理族","text":"3. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"4.-分离规则","text":"4. 分离规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-证明序列","text":"5. 证明序列","level":1},{"id":"6.-可导性","text":"6. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"7.-定理集合","text":"7. 定理集合","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{